cription":"Winner – Renovated Kitchen","year":"23"},{"heading":"HIA Victoria","description":"Winner – Custom Home Under $3m","year":"20"}]}},"__N_SSG":true,"pageProps":{"data":{"page":{"seo":{"title":"About - Haven","description":"","canonical":"https://www.havenconstructions.com.au/about/","openGraph":{"title":"About - Haven","description":"","image":{"url":"","alt":""}},"twitter":{"title":"","description":"","image":{"url":"","alt":""}},"noindex":false,"nofollow":false}},"blocks":[{"type":"section-intro","heading":"Defined by precision, modernity and quiet luxury","subheading":"About us","content":"<p>Through three generations, we’ve developed a building practice grounded in bespoke craftsmanship. We collaborate closely with leading architects and consultants to bring ideas and dreams into reality. Every project reflects our commitment to creating spaces that are not only visually striking but also thoughtfully functional, tailored to the lifestyles of the people who inhabit them.</p>\n<p>At Haven, we don’t just build homes—we craft experiences.</p>\n","cta":false,"image":null,"video":null},{"type":"image","imageCount":"1","imageWidth":"full","caption":false,"captionSecondary":false,"image":{"id":"cG9zdDoxNDk=","alt":"","caption":"","sourceUrl":"https://haven.api.jtbadev.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Hero-Image_SML.jpg","width":3802,"height":2534,"blurPlaceholder":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRmwAAABXRUJQVlA4IGAAAADQAQCdASoQAAsAA4BaJYgCw7CQgBFUgAD+67DiHAGxgV0Y9vHCpUpLXDCG6uIES2mBWCoAS+nboxz/7zFKhpySq21Ab7mXjOZJh+NEyLpK5I14/KpIxeQHelxBQEKAAAA="},"imageSecondary":null,"video":{"id":"cG9zdDo2MDU=","caption":"","url":"https://vz-a28667fb-df9.b-cdn.net/07a24f4a-4f05-4fd2-9047-d3c10800a6fc/playlist.m3u8","width":2560,"height":1440},"videoSecondary":null},{"type":"section-intro","heading":"Three generations. One philosophy.","subheading":"Our story","content":"<p>What began as a family trade has evolved into a pursuit of design excellence. We’re driven by the details others overlook &#8211; the join, the line, the finish &#8211; because these are where the defining moments define live. Haven emerged from a lifelong immersion in the world of building; where every generation has contributed to a shared legacy of skill, dedication and pride in craft. This evolution is guided by a simple principle: to do it right, every step of the way.</p>\n","cta":false,"image":null,"video":null},{"type":"image-three-column","images":[{"image":{"id":"cG9zdDoxNTE=","alt":"","caption":"","sourceUrl":"https://haven.api.jtbadev.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Three-Gen_1.jpg","width":3312,"height":3312,"blurPlaceholder":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRoIAAABXRUJQVlA4IHYAAABwAgCdASoQABAAA4BaJZgCdAYtVmp6tTBjl4sAAP0C/pGH5Nwt4IOMwnryS/bZCbjLeu0PuWN6f5aq2rLy0q2bM7PdfY4/q+RuT8whWq6pmwWAAuSdRvsHvkrvl/9eD4vGV9NDqTZkhOEYmw2zV1OCnNhBAgAA"},"video":false},{"image":{"id":"cG9zdDoxNTY=","alt":"","caption":"","sourceUrl":"https://haven.api.jtbadev.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Three-Gen_2-1.jpg","width":3312,"height":3312,"blurPlaceholder":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRoAAAABXRUJQVlA4IHQAAAAwAgCdASoQABAAA4BaJZQAD48POwbFKF5iAAD+Phw7NB0LDXL1dFD2xzLW5GOFP13Cx0BlMAPr2im39f8lPffpLuhD9XGrWFY+k/XiatGFExrmdsdpwE0D7ZJsQJoKvS7aLrHlA2WmB73Vjz2wt7Y0eKgQAA=="},"video":false},{"image":{"id":"cG9zdDoxNTc=","alt":"","caption":"","sourceUrl":"https://haven.api.jtbadev.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Three-Gen_3-1.jpg","width":3312,"height":3312,"blurPlaceholder":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRnYAAABXRUJQVlA4IGoAAAAwAgCdASoQABAAA4BaJQBdgMXXpEGsPpcYAAD+CnJ5o67+tQosmvzd6vLjsEJNLfDMnzzu3+xXsKMmUuQDaBj59jLhUiac1leBnBRsZ5YJkSYY9aV1y7XX5PG7BImsOYp/fErvKwwcVAAA"},"video":false}]},{"type":"section-intro","heading":"People of precision","subheading":"No compromise","content":"<p>Precision is at the heart of everything we do. Every element, whether structural, material or aesthetic, is carefully considered and executed to achieve perfection. Our relentless pursuit of precision ensures that every home i